<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
	<LocalizedText>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_COMMAND_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>[COLOR:ResGoldLabelCS]联机计时指令[ENDCOLOR]</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_COMMAND_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>允许公共聊天使用 p+/p++ 加时、p-/p-- 减时，以及 p+++ 临时关闭本回合计时。所有修改仅由房主执行。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_15_TIME_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>[COLOR:ResGoldLabelCS]15 秒计时提醒[ENDCOLOR]</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_15_TIME_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>在剩余 15 至 8 秒时播放逐秒提示音。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_ERA_LENGTH_OPTIMIZATION_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>时代长度优化</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_ERA_LENGTH_OPTIMIZATION_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>固定世界时代持续时间：标准速度下依次为远古50、古典46、中世纪46、文艺复兴42、工业42、现代40、原子能40、信息40回合；联机速度下依次为25、23、23、21、21、20、20、20回合。未来时代为最终时代，不参与常规时代结算。默认开启。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>外交栏情报模式</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>设置右上角外交栏采用个人或团队外交能见度。分数、科技值、文化值、积存信仰、外交支持及每回合外交支持始终可见；有限能见度解锁军力，公开解锁总人口、粮食与生产力，秘密解锁积存金币及每回合金币与信仰，绝密解锁当前研究的科技与市政。未解锁的情报显示为问号，未接触的玩家仍保持匿名。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_FFA_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>FFA 模式</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_FFA_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>只使用本地玩家对目标玩家的外交能见度。默认选项。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_TEAM_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>组队模式</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_TEAM_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>使用本队所有玩家对目标玩家的最高外交能见度；队友之间完整共享情报。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开局加成玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>按大厅中真人玩家从上到下的次序选择获得开局加成的玩家。空位、AI和观察者不计入编号；若所选号码不存在，则不会发放加成。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_TYPE_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开局加成</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_TYPE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>选择额外发放给指定玩家的开局单位。加成只在新游戏开始时发放一次，读档不会重复发放。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_NONE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>无</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_NONE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>不选择玩家或不发放额外开局单位。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_1" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>1号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_2" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>2号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_3" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>3号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_4" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>4号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_5" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>5号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_6" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>6号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_7" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>7号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_8" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>8号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_9" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>9号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_10" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>10号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_11" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>11号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_12" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>12号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_SLOT_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>号码对应大厅中真人玩家从上到下的次序。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开局工人</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>所选玩家开局额外获得一名建造者。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_SCOUT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开局侦察兵</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_SCOUT_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>所选玩家开局额外获得一名侦察兵。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER_SCOUT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开局工人+侦察兵</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER_SCOUT_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>所选玩家开局额外获得一名建造者和一名侦察兵。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_MODE_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份局模式</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_MODE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>开启大厅内置身份局：房主在大厅内统一随机发放主公、忠臣、反贼和内奸身份。关闭时不改变普通游戏。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_LOYALIST_COUNT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>忠臣人数</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_REBEL_COUNT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>反贼人数</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_SPY_COUNT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>内奸人数</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_COUNT_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份局中该身份的数量。主公固定为1人，身份总数必须等于大厅中的真人玩家人数。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_COUNT_VALUE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>选择该身份数量。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_SEPARATE_PLAYER_1_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>隔离玩家一</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_SEPARATE_PLAYER_2_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>隔离玩家二</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_SEPARATE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>按大厅中真人玩家从上到下的次序选择。两名玩家必须分属不同阵营；选择“无”表示不启用隔离约束。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_DEAL_DATA_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份发放数据</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_DEAL_DATA_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>由房主在大厅生成并同步的隐藏身份数据。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_DEAL_BUTTON" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>发身份</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_REDEAL_BUTTON" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>重新发身份</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_DEAL_BUTTON_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>按当前真人名单和身份数量发牌；已经准备的玩家会因房间配置更新而取消准备。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_VIEW_BUTTON" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>查看身份</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_WAITING_BUTTON" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>等待房主发身份</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_PANEL_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份局</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_PLAYER_ORDER" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>大厅第{1_num}号玩家</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_REVEAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>点击查看我的身份</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_REVEAL_HINT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>确认旁边没有其他玩家后再打开</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_HIDE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>重新遮住身份</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_CLOSE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>关闭</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_LORD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>主公</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_LOYALIST" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>忠臣</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_REBEL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>反贼</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_SPY" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>内奸</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_LORD_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>你是主公。忠臣与你同阵营。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_LOYALIST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>你与主公同阵营，但不知道其他忠臣是谁。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_REBEL_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>你属于反贼阵营，可以看到其他反贼队友。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ROLE_SPY_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>你是独立阵营，不属于主忠或反贼阵营。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_LORD_LABEL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>本局主公</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_REBEL_TEAM_LABEL" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>反贼队友</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_NO_TEAMMATE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>没有其他反贼</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_NAME_SEPARATOR" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>、</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份局配置无效</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_COUNT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份人数合计必须等于大厅中的真人玩家人数，且至少需要1名反贼。</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_SELECTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>隔离玩家必须选择两名不同的真人玩家，或将两个选项都设为“无”。</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_NO_SOLUTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>当前身份配置无法让指定的两人处于不同阵营，请增加反贼或内奸后重试。</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_NOT_DEALT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>房主尚未在大厅发放身份。请等待房主点击“发身份”。</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_STALE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>真人名单或身份设置在发牌后发生了变化，请房主重新发身份。</Text></Row>
<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_ERROR_DATA" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>身份发放数据不完整或已损坏。请确认所有玩家使用完全相同的 Mod 文件后重新开局。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_FOOD_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>全帝国每回合食物盈余</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_PRODUCTION_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>全帝国每回合生产力</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_GOLD_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合金币</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_FAITH_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合信仰</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_RESEARCH_LOCKED_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>达到绝密外交能见度后显示当前研究项目。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DPR_TOTAL_POPULATION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>总人口</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DPR_FOOD_SURPLUS_YIELD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合食物盈余</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DPR_PRODUCTION_YIELD" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合生产力</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DPR_GOLD_PERTURN" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合金币</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DPR_FAITH_PERTURN" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合信仰</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DPR_FAVOR_PERTURN" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>每回合外交支持</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_QUICK_ADD_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>公共聊天发送 p++：本回合每次加时 20 秒，每回合最多 6 次；不足 8 秒时每次加时 24 秒。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_QUICK_REDUCE_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>公共聊天发送 p--：本回合减时 10 秒，最低 40 秒，每回合限一次。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_RANDOM_TEAMS" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>随机分队</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_RANDOM_TEAMS_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>房主将已连接的真人参赛者随机且均衡地分入两队；排除 AI、观察者和空槽。</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOGGLE_SLOTS" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>空位开关</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOGGLE_SLOTS_TT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>有开放空位时关闭全部空位；没有开放空位时增加一个空位。</Text></Row>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_SETTLER_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>可创建新城市。完成时，该城市 [ICON_Citizen] 人口减1。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]建立首座城市前，开拓者+1 [ICON_Movement] 移动力，忽略地形和过河移动力消耗，上船和下船不消耗 [ICON_Movement] 移动力。</Text></Replace>

		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_COMMAND_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>[COLOR:ResGoldLabelCS]Multiplayer timer commands[ENDCOLOR]</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_COMMAND_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Enables public-chat p+/p++ time extension, p-/p-- time reduction, and p+++ temporary no-timer commands. Only the host applies changes.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_15_TIME_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>[COLOR:ResGoldLabelCS]15-second warning[ENDCOLOR]</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_TOOLS_15_TIME_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Plays a countdown sound from 15 through 8 seconds remaining.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_ERA_LENGTH_OPTIMIZATION_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Era Length Optimization</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_ERA_LENGTH_OPTIMIZATION_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Sets fixed World Era durations: at Standard speed, Ancient, Classical, Medieval, Renaissance, Industrial, Modern, Atomic, and Information last 50, 46, 46, 42, 42, 40, 40, and 40 turns; at Online speed they last 25, 23, 23, 21, 21, 20, 20, and 20 turns. The Future Era is the terminal era and is not part of the regular era schedule. Enabled by default.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Diplomacy Ribbon Intelligence</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Sets whether the top-right diplomacy ribbon uses individual or team Diplomatic Visibility. Score, Science and Culture yields, stored Faith, and Diplomatic Favor with its per-turn change are always visible. Limited reveals Military Strength; Open reveals total Population, Food, and Production; Secret reveals stored Gold plus Gold and Faith per turn; Top Secret reveals current Technology and Civic research. Locked intelligence is shown as a question mark, while unmet players remain anonymous.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_FFA_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>FFA Mode</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_FFA_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Uses only the local player's Diplomatic Visibility on each target. This is the default.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_TEAM_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Team Mode</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_DIPLOMACY_RIBBON_MODE_TEAM_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Uses the highest Diplomatic Visibility that any teammate has on each target; teammates share full intelligence.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Starting Bonus Player</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Selects the human player who receives the starting bonus by top-to-bottom lobby order. Empty, AI and observer rows are not counted. No bonus is granted if the selected number does not exist.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_TYPE_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Starting Bonus</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_TYPE_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Selects the extra starting units granted to the chosen player. The bonus is granted once at the start of a new game and is not repeated after loading a save.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_NONE" Language="en_US"><Text>None</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_NONE_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Selects no player or grants no extra starting units.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_1" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 1</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_2" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 2</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_3" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 3</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_4" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 4</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_5" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 5</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_6" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 6</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_7" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 7</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_8" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 8</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_9" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 9</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_10" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 10</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_11" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 11</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_12" Language="en_US"><Text>Player 12</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_PLAYER_SLOT_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>The number follows the top-to-bottom order of human players in the lobby.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER" Language="en_US"><Text>Starting Builder</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>The selected player starts with one additional Builder.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_SCOUT" Language="en_US"><Text>Starting Scout</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_SCOUT_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>The selected player starts with one additional Scout.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER_SCOUT" Language="en_US"><Text>Starting Builder + Scout</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_STARTING_BONUS_BUILDER_SCOUT_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>The selected player starts with one additional Builder and one additional Scout.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_MODE_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Identity Game Mode</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_MODE_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Enables the built-in identity game: the host deals Lord, Loyalist, Rebel and Spy roles in the lobby. Disabled leaves normal games unchanged.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_LOYALIST_COUNT_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Loyalist Count</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_REBEL_COUNT_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Rebel Count</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_SPY_COUNT_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Spy Count</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_COUNT_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Number of players with this role. Lord is fixed at one; role totals must equal the number of human players in the lobby.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZYL_IDENTITY_COUNT_VALUE_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Select the number of players with this role.</Text></Row>
